					<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>News Ticker</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    /* --- Base Wrapper --- */
    .ticker-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      white-space: nowrap;
      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
      background: #F79633;
      padding: 4px 0;
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 110px; /* space for label */
      height: 32px; /* compact height */
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    /* --- Moving ticker --- */
    .ticker {
      display: inline-block;
      animation: scroll-left 90s linear infinite;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .ticker__item {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0 14px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    /* --- Fixed label --- */
    .news-label {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      padding: 5px 10px 5px 12px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: #E68526; /* slightly darker tone for contrast */
      border-top-right-radius: 4px;
      border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
      z-index: 30;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    /* --- Animation --- */
    @keyframes scroll-left {
      0% { transform: translateX(0%); }
      100% { transform: translateX(-50%); }
    }

    /* Pause on hover */
    .ticker:hover {
      animation-play-state: paused;
    }

    /* --- Responsive --- */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .ticker-wrap {
        padding-left: 95px;
        height: 28px;
      }
      .news-label {
        font-size: 12px;
        padding: 4px 8px;
      }
      .ticker__item {
        font-size: 12px;
        padding: 0 10px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="ticker-wrap">
    <div class="news-label">📰 News Update</div>
    <div class="ticker">
      <div class="ticker__item">Assam signed Concession Agreement on 25th    <div class="ticker__item">4 cities Guwahati, Bhavnagar, Nagpur, Chandigarh were first amongst 116 cities to start operations in Feb 2026.</div> </div>
      <div class="ticker__item">Nagpur signed Escrow Agreement on 24th June, 2025.</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">Karnataka, Gujarat, Rajasthan received RBI acknowledgement for Direct Debit Mandate (DDM).</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">Letter of confirmed quantity (LoCQ) issued for 6228 buses under PM-eBus Sewa tender.</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">Operation support of ₹24/km for standard 12m buses.</div>
    <div class="ticker__item">Letter of Award (LOA) issued for 5718 buses across 82 cities under PM-eBus Sewa tender.</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">PM-eBus Sewa prioritizes cities that do not have organised bus services.</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">Behind-the-meter power infra gets 100% central assistance.</div>
       <div class="ticker__item">Concession agreement signed for 4470 Buses across 56 cities.</div>

      <!-- Duplicate content for seamless loop -->
       <div class="ticker__item">4 cities Guwahati, Bhavnagar, Nagpur, Chandigarh were first amongst 116 cities to start operations in Feb 2026.</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">Assam signed Concession Agreement on 25th June, 2025.</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">Nagpur signed Escrow Agreement on 24th June, 2025.</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">Karnataka, Gujarat, Rajasthan received RBI acknowledgement for Direct Debit Mandate (DDM).</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">Letter of confirmed quantity (LoCQ) issued for 6228 buses under PM-eBus Sewa tender.</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">Operation support of ₹24/km for standard 12m buses.</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">Letter of Award (LOA) issued for 5718 buses across 82 cities under PM-eBus Sewa tender.</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">PM-eBus Sewa prioritizes cities that do not have organised bus services
      <div class="ticker__item">Behind-the-meter power infra gets 100% central assistance.</div>
      <div class="ticker__item">Concession agreement signed for 4470 Buses across 56 cities.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
